{"unit_id":"LeemanCheung__dsh-vibe-pack#card-zh","repo":"LeemanCheung/dsh-vibe-pack","commit":"501d6dc022b5862d50b609f2da545970110119a9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vibe-pack 是一款面向 DSH Web 的本地数据配置包管理插件。它在 Settings 中加入 Vibe Pack 面板，并提供命令行工具 dsh-pack。用户可以检查本地目录或归档、预览配置包的安装计划、安装和卸载资源、查看已安装内容的差异，并导出为 .dshpack 文件。管理记录保存在 DSH_HOME 下，支持 create、replace 和 merge 操作。适合希望通过本地配置包整理或迁移 DSH 配置资源的用户；使用前需要安装到 DSH Web Profile，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-vibe-pack/src/client/index.tsx:123-129","packages/dsh-vibe-pack/src/client/index.tsx:135-150","packages/dsh-vibe-pack/src/core/manager.ts:50-76","packages/dsh-vibe-pack/src/core/manager.ts:141-165"]}
